        "order": 1,
        "positioning": {
          "en": "Mono-Red Madness accounts for nearly 30% of this week’s high-score decklists and a quarter of the Top 8 field. Its share of Top 8 finishes over the last four weeks also exceeds 20%—a substantial presence in Pauper’s traditionally diverse metagame. And it is delivering results as well as numbers: Mono-Red Madness reached the Top 4 in four of this week’s five events and won three of them. This is the winning list from the largest of those three events.",
          "zh": "纯红疯魔本周高分占比已经接近30%，八强占比也有四分之一。近四周的平均八强占比更是已经超过20%。这在一直相对比较开放的纯铁环境是相当有分量的数据。而且并不只是数量上压倒，质量也很强。本周五场比赛只有一场四强中没有纯红疯魔，而疯魔席卷了其中的三场。  这是三场席卷中人数最多的一场的冠军牌表。"
